#@case external-type-definition-old-version-degrades-to-any: registry.md §7.2 —
# a locked external Type Definition whose observed R package version
# (`typr.lock`'s `r_version_seen`) is below the manifest's `since` floor must
# degrade to Any for every one of its names, even at tier `T1` (normally
# trusted outright). `sprocket` declares `@turn_sprocket: (int) -> int;` at
# tier `T1`, `since = "2.0.0"`, but was locked against R package `1.0.0` —
# below the floor.
let result <- turn_sprocket("not-an-int");
print(result);
